T[1725]={"^Snipe Firing Rate increased by (.-)%%, but it deals (.-)%% increased damage and has (.-)%% increased Critical Strike Chance%.%s*$","A taxa de disparo de Snipe aumenta em {{1}}%, mas causa {{2}}% mais dano e tem uma maior Chance de Acerto Crítico do {{3}}%."}
