T[12459]={"^Your bleed effects deal (.-)%% increased damage%. Eviscerate and Dispatch deal (.-)%% increased damage versus monsters%.%s*$","Seus efeitos de hemorragia causam {{1}}% de dano adicional. Sangrar e Executar causam {{2}}% de dano adicional contra monstros."}
