T[12724]={"^Elemental Blast does (.-)%% more damage and its critical strike chance is increased by (.-)%%%.%s*$","Elemental Explosão há dano adicional de {{1}}% e aumenta sua Chance de Acerto Crítico em {{2}}%."}
