T[14732]={"^Inflicts Fire damage to all enemies, reduced as further they are away from the caster%.%s*$","Causa dano de Fogo todos os inimigos, reduzidos conforme estes se alejen do conjurador."}
T[14733]={"^Hurls molten lava at the target, inflicting Fire damage and burns the target, inflicting additional Fire damage based on the damage inflicted every second for (.-)%.%s*$","Lança lava fundida o alvo, causando dano de Fogo e quemándolo, o que causa dano adicional de Fogo baseado no dano causado a cada segundo durante {{1}}."}
